1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
一种江边的吃法，成了连锁帝国
A riverside meal became an empire

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
起源四川乐山，岷江边
It began by the Min River in Leshan

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
纤夫拉船，江边架起瓦罐
Boat trackers set clay pots on the bank,

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
捡柴生火，辣椒花椒煮野菜
firewood, chili, peppercorn, wild greens

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
一锅烫熟，驱寒又顶饿
One boil — warm, filling, done

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
码头小贩，挑起担子叫卖
Dock vendors carried it pole by pole

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
自己拿夹子，一样样选菜
Grab the tongs, pick dish by dish,

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
称重算钱，想吃啥拿啥
weighed by the gram — take what you want

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
杨国福·张亮，两个东北人
Yang Guofu and Zhang Liang — two Northeasterners

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
把四川的烫，开遍了全国
spread Sichuan's boil nationwide

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,200
四川人只说仨字：巴适得板
A Sichuan verdict: bāshì-dé-bǎn — perfect

12
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,400
沙县·兰州·黄焖鸡·麻辣烫
Shaxian, Lanzhou, chicken rice, malatang

13
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:28,800
你的工位续命神器，是哪个？
Your desk-lunch savior — which one?
